# Netlify response headers.
#
# The Scheme of Work tracker (wcib-sow.netlify.app) reads the whole-school
# key dates from this site, which is a cross-origin request. GitHub Pages
# allowed that automatically; Netlify does not, so the shared data files
# need to say explicitly that other sites may read them.
#
# This applies only to /data/ — the pages themselves stay as they are.

/data/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
